%% Spatial touched update sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  participant Applier as CommitApplier
  participant Runtime as RuntimeRoot
  participant ReadPort as FrameFactsPort
  participant Spatial as SpatialKernel
  participant Membership as SpatialMembership
  participant HitIndex as Hit TileIndex and OutlierIndex
  participant PaintIndex as Paint TileIndex and OutlierIndex
  participant SpatialCounters as Spatial non-hub counters
  participant Signals as Public state/effects

  Applier-->>Runtime: CommitDeliveryResult with SpatialDeliveryEffect(TouchedSet)
  Runtime->>Spatial: applyTouched(FrameFactsPort, touched ids)
  alt document replacement
    Spatial->>Spatial: schedule replacement rebuild from committed frame facts
    Note over Spatial: Current index is dropped, and the next spatial query rebuilds it. Ordinary touched delta work does not run.
  else clear with zero post-clear elements
    Spatial->>Spatial: resetEmpty at accepted structuralRevision
    Note over Spatial: Empty reset is valid only for a genuinely zero-element committed frame.
  else ordinary prepared touched delta, including retained-background clear
    Spatial->>Spatial: compile SpatialDelta from touched added/removed/geometry/transform ids
    Note over Spatial: Ordinary edit scope contains touched ids only. Full spatial clone for ordinary edit is forbidden.

    Spatial->>Membership: read previous membership for touched ids
    Membership-->>Spatial: previous hit and paint tile/outlier membership
    Note over Spatial,ReadPort: Spatial reads committed bounds through FrameFactsPort only, not concrete store tables.
    Spatial->>ReadPort: read new committed bounds and generation for added/geometry/transform ids
    ReadPort-->>Spatial: current hitBoundsWorld, paintBoundsWorld, generation, orderToken, structuralRevision

    Spatial->>Spatial: prepare removals from previous memberships
    Spatial->>Spatial: prepare additions from new hitBoundsWorld and paintBoundsWorld
    Spatial->>Spatial: validate ids, generations, structuralRevision, and prepared memberships

    alt validation accepts prepared delta
      Spatial->>HitIndex: apply removals for touched ids
      Spatial->>PaintIndex: apply removals for touched ids
      Spatial->>HitIndex: apply prepared additions for added/geometry/transform ids
      Spatial->>PaintIndex: apply prepared additions for added/geometry/transform ids
      Spatial->>Membership: replace/remove entriesById for touched ids
      Spatial-->>Runtime: touched spatial update committed
      Note over Spatial,Runtime: Atomic apply publishes only complete touched-id membership changes.
      Note over Spatial,PaintIndex: A retained-background clear removes only actual content ids, while untouched background paint membership remains. Hit/context eligibility is unchanged.
    else stale id, generation, structuralRevision, or membership validation fails
      Spatial->>Spatial: discard prepared delta without applying partial removals/additions
      Spatial->>Spatial: mark spatial index invalid
      Spatial->>SpatialCounters: increment invalid-index counter, not a DiagnosticsHub write
      Spatial-->>Runtime: typed invalid-index result
      Runtime->>Runtime: request rebuild or retry outside hot pointer/paint path
      Note over Spatial,Runtime: Until rebuild, invalid index behavior is bounded fallback or typed budget-exceeded only, and silent full-scene scan is forbidden.
      Note over HitIndex,PaintIndex: No partial index mutation is accepted from a stale delta.
    end
  end

  opt successful loadDocument replacement
    Runtime->>Spatial: rebuild full spatial index from replacement tables
    Note over Spatial,Runtime: Load rebuild is a RuntimeRoot post-install effect, not an ordinary touched update.
  end

  Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState after spatial delivery
  Runtime->>Signals: forward CommitEffectObserver effects after spatial delivery
